## 5. Current Debugging Status

An earlier simulation produced unknown (X) values for the PC, instruction output, registers and data memory.

Reset initialization and instruction-memory file loading were identified as important areas to investigate.

The ALU-control ADDI/SUB decoding issue was also identified.

**Final verification status: Pending successful simulation and comparison against all expected values.**

## 6. Conclusion

The extended test program covers the major arithmetic, logical, memory-access and control-flow operations of the RV32I single-cycle processor.

The processor will be considered successfully verified when the simulation produces the expected final register values, memory contents and PC address without unknown values.